a.xlink:title:
FYI plot of the dither positions (arcsec) of every case of one instrument, with the nominal square the ANALYSIS assumes; stamped with the TBD distortion warning.
INPUTS: - results_dir (str): where to write fyi_sim_<label>_dither_geometry.png - label (str): e.g. 'METIS-1095_Br_alpha' - dither_offset_arcsec (float): nominal dither offset - cases_info (dict): case -> {positions, fov_injected, fov_measured, expected} - limit_spec (dict): the requirement's FoV limit {value: [lo, hi], ...}
OUTPUTS: - str: path of the written plot
